{
  "name": "UMKM 06 — Minta Review Google (Setelah Order Done)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "mode": "everyMinute"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Orders",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "event": "rowUpdated",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Order Status Changed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets UMKM"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json['Status'] || $json['status'] }}",
              "rightValue": "SELESAI",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-done",
      "name": "Status = DONE?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 24,
        "unit": "hours"
      },
      "id": "wait",
      "name": "Wait 24 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "v1",
              "name": "pesan",
              "value": "=Halo {{ $json['Name'] || $json['name'] || 'Kak' }}! 👋\n\nThank you for ordering from *[YOUR STORE NAME]* 🙏\n\nWe hope you love the product!\n\nIf you have a minute, please help us with a review on Google:\n👉 https://g.page/r/REPLACE_PLACE_ID/review\n\nYour review helps small shops like ours grow. Thank you so much! ⭐",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format",
      "name": "Prepare Review Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        900,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.fonnte.com/send",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "REPLACE_FONNTE_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "target",
              "value": "={{ $json['Chat ID'] || $json['chat_id'] || 'REPLACE_ADMIN_WHATSAPP_NUMBER' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "send",
      "name": "Send Minta Review (WhatsApp)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        220
      ],
      "notes": "Token Fonnte from dashboard fonnte.com -> Device -> Token. Ganti REPLACE_FONNTE_TOKEN.",
      "notesInFlow": false
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## UMKM 06 — Automatic Review Request\n\n**Why this is the most worth building for a client:**\nThis is the automation with the clearest ROI. Google reviews = new customers trust you = sales go up.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Order status in Sheets is changed to *SELESAI*\n2. Wait 24 hours (so the customer has time to use the product)\n3. Send a review request message + Google link\n\n**What to edit:**\n- `[NAMA TOKO ANDA]`\n- `GANTI_PLACE_ID` → your Google Business review link\n- `GANTI_SPREADSHEET_ID`\n\n**How to get the review link:**\n1. Google Business Profile → Ask for reviews\n2. Copy the link that appears\n\n**Note:**\nIf the customer is not yet on WhatsApp, switch the send node to WhatsApp/Email.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "note",
      "name": "Panduan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Order Status Changed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Status = DONE?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Status = DONE?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 24 Hours",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Wait 24 Hours": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Prepare Review Message",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Prepare Review Message": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Minta Review (WhatsApp)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "pinData": {}
}